<title>USA: TB Wood's Corp buys Graseby unit.</title>
<headline>TB Wood's Corp buys Graseby unit.</headline>
<dateline>CHAMBERSBURG, Pa. 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>TB Wood's Corp said on Friday that its TB Wood's Inc subsidiary bought Graseby Controls Inc from Graseby Plc of London.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed. Graseby Controls, of Greensboro, N.C., makes machine tool spindle drives, electronic brakes and other products. Its 1996 revenues exceeded $5 million.</p>
<p>TB Wood's makes electronic and mechanical industrial power transmission products. Its shares were up 7/8 to 15-7/8 in late-morning trading on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
